  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1179/301/unbenannt-png.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>簡介：</strong></p>\n<p>Creepy Mob 是一款 Minecraft 資源包，旨在為各種生物增添發光的眼睛。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1009/662/taxcm.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>相關資訊：</strong></p>\n<p>此資源包特別為「Cave Horror Project」整合包所設計。歡迎嘗試這個精彩的資源包。需要安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a>&nbsp;(Entity Texture Feature) 模組。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/cave-horror-project\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/976/277/chp.png\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>安裝方式：</strong></p>\n<p>只需將 .zip 檔拖曳至 .minecraft/resourcepack 資料夾內，或直接使用 CurseForge 客戶端即可。</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1175/74/taxtv-05-png.png\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>使用許可：</strong></p>\n<p>您被允許且歡迎將此資源包用於您的整合包中。&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1175/80/taxdl-boss-png.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>製作人員：</strong></p>\n<p>由 Taknax 製作</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1172/468/taknax-title-png.png\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
